# Precious

Read [AGENTS.md](../AGENTS.md) before making changes.

- Engine (`packages/core`, `packages/providers`) → public repo only
- Panel UI → `packages/panel` (shared MIT)
- Marketing/auth → `precious-cloud/apps/web` only (proprietary)
- Local = no login; Cloud = multi-tenant auth required
- Failover must preserve full message context
